<title>USA: iMALL names Tracy Scott CEO.</title>
<headline>iMALL names Tracy Scott CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PROVO, Utah 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>iMALL Inc said on Monday that it named Tracy Scott as chief executive officer, effective October 7.</p>
<p>Craig Pickering, who had previously served as chief executive, will remain president and chairman of iMALL while assuming the additional responsibility of directing the company's expansion into international markets.</p>
<p>iMALL Inc and its wholly owned subsidiary companies form the nation's largest full service Internet commerce group.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
